<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: EU leaders may agree EMU pact principles.</title>
<headline>EU leaders may agree EMU pact principles.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish finance minister Sauli Niinisto said EU leaders might agree on Friday the text of a draft accord to enforce fiscal discipline under monetary union, but they might defer specifying the figures in the text.</p>
<p>The figures refer to how far a country's GDP would have to fall for it to be exempt from fines for running big budget deficits under the proposed stability pact.</p>
</text>
